-#
  A donation appeal (markdown, placeholders already expanded) beside the
  amount box, which sits against the fieldset's right edge. The two columns
  hold at every width: on phones the text shrinks (frontend.css) rather than
  the box dropping below it. Locals: text, order_form, field.
.grid-x.grid-padding-x.align-middle.donation-appeal
  .small-8.medium-9.cell.donation-appeal__text
    = display_markdown(text)
  .small-4.medium-3.cell.text-right.donation-appeal__amount
    = order_form.label field, '$', class: 'inline', style: 'display:inline'
    = order_form.input_field field, size: 8, style: 'display:inline; width:auto'
